# Environment

Copy to `.env` and fill in. Never commit `.env`.

```
FALKORDB_HOST=localhost
FALKORDB_PORT=6379
# optional, only if a zone requires auth
FALKORDB_PASSWORD=

# used by the labeler only, and only at ingest time — never at runtime
LLM_API_KEY=
```

The runtime path does not use an LLM and does not hold database credentials in
the model context. See `AI_DISCLOSURE.md`.
